  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "青瓷书房 · 阅读与书库套件": "Celadon Study · Reading & Library Suite",
      "面向 EPUB、Kindle（AZW3/MOBI/KF8）、FB2、DOCX、MHTML 长文、PDF、漫画画集（CBZ/CBT/CBR/CB7 随包原生按需取图引擎、GBK/Shift-JIS 老漫画编码自动还原与跨平台降级）与长篇 TXT 的一站式个人阅读与藏书套件。提供青瓷书架、Calibre 式书目台账、多格式精读体验与书摘重温工作台。": "An all-in-one personal reading and book library suite for EPUB, Kindle (AZW3/MOBI/KF8), FB2, DOCX, MHTML articles, PDF, comics/artbooks (with bundled on-demand native page engine, automatic GBK/Shift-JIS archive filename decoding, and cross-platform fallback), and long-form TXT novels — featuring a tactile bookshelf, Calibre-style catalog table, deep reading modes, and a highlights review hub.",
      "青瓷书房 · 书架模式": "Celadon Study · Bookshelf",
      "以实体书架展示全库多格式藏书与阅读进度，并配书房主页；左侧导航与智能工具容器自动切换筛选和书籍目录，右侧查看并编辑书目详情。": "Browse your multi-format library on a tactile bookshelf paired with Study Desk, smart contextual navigation on the left, and metadata inspector on the right.",
      "书目台账 · Calibre 模式": "Book Catalog · Calibre Table",
      "以表格逐行整理作者、丛书、出版年、ISBN、评分、标签与阅读状态，并附年度书墙标签页，适合批量校对与编目。": "Curate authors, series, years, ISBNs, ratings, tags, and reading status row by row in a table alongside the Year Wall.",
      "精读与摘录工作台": "Deep Reading & Highlights Studio",
      "面向深度阅读、批注整理与每日重温：搭配书摘馆、按阅读状态分组的青瓷书架、智能上下文目录容器与右侧详情检查器。": "Built for focused study, annotation, and daily review — pairing the Highlights Hub with a state-grouped bookshelf, smart book navigation, and inspector.",
