      "一站式个人藏书与精读空间：支持 EPUB、Kindle、PDF、漫画画集与长篇 TXT，配备实体书架、书目台账与书摘回跳。": "Personal reading room for EPUB, Kindle, PDF, comics, and long TXT files — with a tactile bookshelf, book catalog table, and highlights that jump back to the exact passage.",
      "按书架陈列多格式藏书与阅读进度，随阅读自动切出章节目录与批注。": "Browse your multi-format library on a bookshelf with reading progress and contextual table of contents.",
